"title: Feature Showcase\n\nauthor: OrgWebAlchemy\n\n<!-- A single comment line. -->\n\n# Introduction\n\nThis paragraph shows **bold**, *italic*, `code`, `verbatim`, <u>underline</u>, ~~strikethrough~~, x<sup>2</sup>, H<sub>2</sub>O.\n\nA forced break here:  \n\n\nand then the continuation.\n\nSee [GNU](https://gnu.org) or a raw link <https://example.org> plus a\n\nfootnote reference[^one] and an inline footnote^[like this].\n\n# Links and images\n\nAn external [documentation link](https://example.org/docs), a bare [notes.org](notes.org),\n\nan ![inline image](photo.png), a bare ![images/diagram.svg](images/diagram.svg) and a jump\n\n[into another file](notes.org).\n\nA local anchor [custom id](#custom-id) and a heading link [up top](#introduction).\n\nMail [the author](mailto:hello@example.org) or dial [tel:+123456](tel:+123456).\n\n[^one] The footnote definition.\n\n# TODO [#A] A Task :work:urgent:\n\n- [ ] unchecked item\n- [x] checked item\n  - nested item\n\n# Lists\n\n1. first\n2. second\n\n**Term**\n:   Definition\n\n- outer\n  1. nested ordered\n  2. another\n**Tail**\n:   detail\n\n# Blocks\n\n```scheme\n(display \"hi\")\n```\n\n```\n*literal*\n```\n\n> Quoted *text*\n\nline one  \nline two\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\ncentered line\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"raw\">Raw HTML</div>\n\n<!-- hidden comment\n-->\n\n    a fixed-width line\n\n---\n\n| Name | Age |\n| --- | --- |\n| Ada | 36 |\n\n"
